user.description:
Hestia Energy reads Home Assistant's Energy dashboard; it controls nothing.

**It needs at least one electricity consumption source** in the [Energy dashboard]({energy}), whichever you like. The most common in France:
- [HA Linky]({ha_linky}): no hardware, yesterday's consumption;
- [MyElectricalData]({myelectricaldata}): no hardware, yesterday's consumption;
- [a module on the Linky]({tic}) (LiXee / ZLinky, linkytic): live consumption.

Any other meter declared in the Energy dashboard works too.
